omaxian-session (1.1.0-1) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * New upstream Omaxian shell v1.1 (tag ae527b75 = main). Upstream's
    "version" file still says v1.0.8; package version comes from
    OMAXIAN_SHELL_REF (normalized v1.1 → 1.1.0).
  * Seed the four community-apps into the home template by default
    (disktree, monologue, omarchy-meeting-recorder, signed) on both ISOs.
    community-plugins remain opt-in (not installed).
  * Runtime Depends for those apps (from each omaxian.deps.json).

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Thu, 05 Nov 2026 18:02:08 +0100

omaxian-session (1.0.6-2) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * omaxian-user-setup: run xdg-user-dirs-update on every login, before the
    "already seeded" exit. Xsession.d/25omaxian-home seeds the home first,
    so on a fresh home the step was always skipped and no Documents,
    Downloads, Music, Pictures, Videos, Templates, Public (or Desktop)
    folders were created; i3 does not run the XDG autostart entry either.

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 20:15:00 +0100

omaxian-session (1.0.6-1) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * New upstream Omaxian shell v1.0.6 (Omarchy v4.5.0-rc2, from the pin in
    its scripts/setup.sh). Upstream's "version" file still says v1.0.5; the
    package version now comes from OMAXIAN_SHELL_REF (build warns on a
    mismatch). Builds with the unchanged home-template filter: no
    keyboard.json from the build host; i3 still includes config.d/*.conf
    and keeps the xfpm power-button 3/unset -> 4 rewrite.

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Sun, 01 Nov 2026 16:30:00 +0100

omaxian-session (1.0.4-1) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * New upstream Omaxian shell v1.0.4 (Omarchy v4.0.6, taken from the pin in
    its scripts/setup.sh). Upstream now also rewrites xfpm power-button-action
    unset/3 (Ask) to 4 (Shutdown) in i3_autostart and omarchy-idle-lock-apply;
    our omaxian-xfpm-defaults (Xsession.d/36omaxian-xfpm) stays as the early,
    login-time default and agrees with it.
  * Home template: drop the keyboard.json that v1.0.4's deploy.sh seeds from
    the build host (it would shadow the installer's layout in /etc/skel and
    the live session's us,it seed), plus python __pycache__ and
    shell.json.bak render leftovers.

 -- Marcello Palmitessa <marcello@omaxian.org>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0100

omaxian-session (1.0.3-4) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Depend on omaxian-fonts-nerd: JetBrains Mono Nerd Font is mandatory
    for the Omaxian session (kitty/alacritty/ghostty, i3 bar, dunst,
    Quickshell) and is now installed system-wide, not only per user.
  * ACPI power button: new omaxian-xfpm-defaults, run at X login from
    Xsession.d/36omaxian-xfpm (before xfconfd/xfce4-power-manager start),
    sets power-button-action=4 (shut down) in the user's
    xfce4-power-manager channel when the user has not chosen a value.
    xfpm's default 3 ("ask") needs the xfce4-session logout dialog, which
    the i3 session does not run, so the power button (incl. a hypervisor
    ACPI power-off) did nothing. xfce4-power-manager's conffile is left
    untouched (diverting another package's conffile is not supported by
    dpkg: the diverted copy is skipped on install and purge deletes the
    original).

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:30:00 +0100

omaxian-session (1.0.3-3) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * omaxian-seed-keyboard (run from Xsession.d/25omaxian-home): create
    ~/.config/omarchy/keyboard.json from /etc/default/keyboard (XKBLAYOUT,
    XKBVARIANT, XKBOPTIONS) at first login, so the installer's keyboard
    choice is used instead of omarchy-keyboard-apply's built-in it,ru.

